sequenceDiagram
    participant Sweep as Booking expiry sweep
    participant Booking as BookingService
    participant Reservation as Phase 7 ReservationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Sweep->>Booking: Select due AWAITING_PAYMENT booking
    Booking->>DB: Lock and recheck status and deadline
    Booking->>Reservation: Read linked allocation state
    alt Allocation is provisional
        Booking->>Reservation: Release with booking correlation and reason
        Reservation->>DB: Release claims idempotently
        Reservation-->>Booking: RELEASED
    else Allocation already expired or released
        Reservation-->>Booking: Existing terminal state
    else Allocation confirmed or uncertain
        Booking->>DB: Leave booking unchanged for reconciliation
    end
    Booking->>DB: Mark EXPIRED, append history and audit
